{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's one thing to compose fascinating stories with unusual characters, but it's quite another to encounter them in real life! The aspiring writer Kosmeya worked on his manuscript for a whole year, but a bad memory, washed-out roads and a creepy forest turned the journey to the Festival of Words into a real adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero will have to meet a new friend, escape from the witch's curse, get out of the forest, and most importantly, have time to present his work to the jury at the most important writing competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a kind and touching story about not giving up and that your dream will definitely come true. Test your attentiveness in a mini-game of find objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a08 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0colorful drawing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0hidden object game</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836660/8bc77d838b13512d470502f44ba44d55fca45fc9.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836660/ab9416164b60dd63e6315885f30c9dedeacf1af0.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836660/484fce7eac641b9fb616d07f799ad446a2eb7461.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836660/5ce0b12549a03bcdc5b58e1cfbebd93d5a522ebd.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836660/6f6771258892ed0fa00c6ad257d856d008220f14.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2836660/d01f10b78081af03ef361e62f9903bb852e66685.jpg"},